WEBVTT

00:01:54.130 --> 00:02:00.563
I think apologizing, reconnecting
with that person in some way,

00:02:00.597 --> 00:02:02.763
repairing the harm that was done.

00:02:03.730 --> 00:02:06.797
And I want to make
a distinction between that

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:13.663
and situations where people feel guilt,
unwarranted guilt, unfair guilt.

00:02:13.697 --> 00:02:16.497
There are times when
we feel guilty over things

00:02:16.497 --> 00:02:19.030
that we're not responsible for.

00:02:19.063 --> 00:02:24.130
And that's a different issue
that is potentially problematic

00:02:24.163 --> 00:02:27.997
because it's hard to fix something
that you're really not responsible for.

00:02:28.030 --> 00:02:30.463
It leaves you in a tough spot,